      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The University of Hawaiʻi at Hilo and the ʻImiloa Astronomy Center make the town a regional hub for space research and astronomy outreach.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
